      <name>Mitzad Hatira (מצודת חתירה)</name>
      <description>One open cistern, part of the Iron Age II water supply in the Negev Highlands, designed to collect runoff water.&#10;&#10;Installation: Deep Well&#10;Era: 09. Iron Age II (-1000 to -586 BCE)&#10;Region: Negev&#10;Precision: Exact Archaeological Site / IAA Grid&#10;Section: 2.9.36&#10;Pages: 171</description>
