    <Placemark>
      <name>Jericho (יריחו)</name>
      <description>During the Middle Bronze Age, the city of Jericho was fortified, and Elisha&apos;s Spring (Ein es-Sultan) was intentionally included within its city walls to provide a secure water source.&#10;&#10;Installation: Spring Cave Capture&#10;Era: 06. Middle Bronze Age (MB) (-2200 to -1550 BCE)&#10;Region: Jordan Valley&#10;Precision: Exact Archaeological Site / IAA Grid&#10;Section: 2.6.3&#10;Pages: 75</description>
